sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant MC as MaterialsController
    participant MS as MaterialsService
    participant JS as JobsService
    participant CO as OcrCoordinator<br/>(in-API sweep, 15 s)
    participant OW as /api/v1/ocr/workers/:id/*
    participant WK as ocr-worker<br/>heartbeat, claim, fetch, extract, submit
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant ST as storage volume

    B->>MC: POST /materials/upload (multipart, chunked)
    MC->>MS: store file (local) → material UPLOADED
    B->>MC: POST /materials/:id/process
    MC->>JS: INSERT jobs (MATERIAL_PROCESS, 'queued')
    Note over JS: MATERIAL_PROCESS is NEVER published to RabbitMQ — OCR is coordinator-owned.
    MS-->>B: 202 {jobId}

    loop Coordinator sweep (every 15 s)
        CO->>DB: adopt queued MATERIAL_PROCESS jobs
        CO->>DB: material → PROCESSING, job → processing
        CO->>DB: materialize chunk 1 (pages 1..CHUNK_SIZE) → ocr_chunks pending
    end

    loop ocr-worker pull loop
        WK->>OW: POST heartbeat (status)
        WK->>OW: POST claim
        OW->>CO: oldest pending (or lease-expired) chunk, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        CO->>DB: chunk → claimed, claimedBy, lease 300 s, attempts+1
        OW-->>WK: {chunk id, index, startPage, endPage, pageCount}
    end

    WK->>OW: GET source/:chunkId
    OW->>ST: read source bytes
    ST-->>WK: file bytes
    WK->>WK: PyMuPDF embedded text ≥ 5 chars/page → else rasterize → PaddleOCR

    alt success
        WK->>OW: POST result {pages[], text, totalPages?}
        CO->>CO: validate page range against chunk
        CO->>DB: chunk → submitted
        alt totalPages > chunk end
            CO->>DB: materialize remaining chunks (missing indexes only)
        end
    else failure
        WK->>OW: POST fail {error, permanent}
        CO->>CO: attempts < MAX=3 and not permanent → back to pending (retry)
    end

    CO->>DB: all chunks submitted + contiguous pages 1..N ⇒ persist text
    CO->>DB: material → READY, job → completed
    Note over DB: Lease-expired / disabled-worker chunks reclaimed by sweep.<br/>Settled failure → material FAILED, job failed (terminal after 3 attempts).